ial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">（五）其它补充事宜</p><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin:3.75pt 0pt 16.5pt;text-indent:34.3pt;padding:0pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:30pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">1.本公示仅为项目技术参数意见征集公告，非投标报名。</p><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin:3.75pt 0pt 16.5pt;text-indent:34.3pt;padding:0pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:30pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">2.欢迎广大供货商积极提供相关意见。</p><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin:3.75pt 0pt 16.5pt;text-indent:34.3pt;padding:0pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:30pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\"> </p><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin:3.75pt 0pt 16.5pt;text-indent:34.3pt;padding:0pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:30pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">附件1：装备技术参数</p><p align=\"justify\" style=\"margin:3.75pt 0pt 16.5pt;text-indent:34.3pt;padding:0pt;text-align:justify;vertical-align:baseline;line-height:30pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;\">附件2：技术参数公开意见反馈表</p><p> </p><p> </p><p><strong>二、开标时间：</strong></p><p> </p><p><strong>三、其它补充事宜</strong></p><p></p><p> </p><p><strong>四、预算金额：</strong></p><p>预算金额：0.000000 万元（人民币）</p><p> </p> <p> </p><p></p>